      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue has occurred for me for a long time and persisted through many versions of VRChat. I've even contacted support and provided various logs to help diagnose the issue, but no updates or fixes have come around yet. The worst part is that it's not even 100% reproducible. Sometimes I can jump around dozens of worlds before it gets stuck at 100, and sometimes it gets stuck on the second or third instance after launching the game. \n\nAfter it initially locks up, there is no way to get back into the game outside of restarting VRChat, which is a pretty big hassle if you're wearing a VR setup. \n\nI can provide logs if need be, I have a few stockpiled from my VRChat Support ticket.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
