      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This happens to me all the time since the 2020.3.2p4 update on August 28th, 2020. Windows also had the feature update to 2004, which I held off on as long as I could. Here is the most recent log. This pattern repeats every time this occurs. I also echo Robert's point regarding its rate of occurrence. Sometime it occurs on the 10th world I load in a session, sometimes on the 2nd or 3rd. The only work around I have at the moment is to restart the client.",
